window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A determined survivor. A terrifying creature of shadow. A society of protectors that could bring her a found family or an early grave.</b></p> <p>Arien Blair yearns to belong. Aged out of the foster system and living on the streets, the desperate eighteen-year-old works odd jobs just to put a roof over her head. But when she’s attacked by a hooded and faceless being, she’s stunned when a brooding warrior steps in and promptly declares he’s duty-bound to protect.</p> <p>Sensing a connection she neither understands nor wants, the fiercely independent young woman tries to escape only to be captured by a trio of winged seraphs and spirited away for training. But the supposed sanctuary for humans carrying angelic blood proves to be a nest of ambitious vipers, and Arien’s beauty paired with unknown potential paints a massive target on her wingless back.</p> <p>Short on trust and friends, can Arien find the home she craves before ruthless rivals clip her wings?</p> <p><i>Sky Ice</i> is the riveting first book in the Earthbounders dark fantasy romance series. If you like strong but wounded heroines, slow-burn relationships, and epic suspense, you’ll adore E. G. Sparks’s pulse-quickening tale.</p> <p>Buy <i>Sky Ice</i> to flirt with fate today!</p>"; 
